10
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:25,259
Let me start with our main conclusion, because

11
00:00:25,259 --> 00:00:27,928
it shapes everything that follows. After

12
00:00:27,928 --> 00:00:30,597
studying ten years of flights, we found delay

13
00:00:30,597 --> 00:00:33,266
is predictable in its structure, even though

14
00:00:33,266 --> 00:00:35,934
individual flights aren't. About three

15
00:00:35,934 --> 00:00:38,603
quarters comes from the airline itself, and a

