61
00:02:45,590 --> 00:02:48,345
Our second finding is about concentration. The

62
00:02:48,345 --> 00:02:51,100
Gini index is zero point eight seven six,

63
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:53,855
meaning a tiny share of flights creates most

64
00:02:53,855 --> 00:02:56,610
of the delay. In plain terms, a few bad

65
00:02:56,610 --> 00:02:59,365
flights cause most of the misery. So we report

66
00:02:59,365 --> 00:03:02,120
percentiles and the heavy tail, and we re-run

67
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,875
